  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "River Buoyage",
    "overview": "Every boat state is a navigation mark: a saturated colour field plus a topmark shape, read at arm's length in sunlight. Libre is a green triangle (▲), a sold ticket is a yellow saltire (✕), a boat out is a blue disc (●), a late boat is the isolated-danger double disc (●●) on red. The shapes come from IALA lateral, special and isolated-danger topmarks and live in the SVG sprite as `m-libre`, `m-ticket`, `m-sortie`, `m-retard`. Colour and shape always travel together.\n\nThe world is a working instrument, not a showcase. Near-black shell bars frame a cool, pale ground by day and true black at night; content sits on white surfaces separated by 1px rules with 4px corners. Saturated colour is spent only on state and on the operator actions that change state, and each action button wears the colour of the state it produces. One typeface, Atkinson Hyperlegible Next, at heavy weights, with tabular figures everywhere so times and countdowns never jitter. Density is high and honest: the number (countdown or overrun) is the biggest thing in a row.\n\nLateness outranks everything. A late boat turns its row's plaque red with the double-disc mark, washes the row pink (dark red at night) inside a 2px red line, raises a sticky red band under the top bar, puts a red count on the filter bar and a red badge on the bottom tab, and paints red/black hazard stripes on the planning timeline.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "State = colour field + buoyage topmark, never colour alone.",
      "Action buttons carry the colour of the state they produce (Vendre yellow, Sortir blue, Retour green).",
      "Black shell, pale cool ground, white surfaces on 1px rules, 4px corners; no shadows on resting content.",
      "One face (Atkinson Next), weights 400 to 800, tabular figures globally.",
      "Day and night themes share the same saturated signal fields; only grounds, inks and on-surface state text change.",
      "Signal yellow is the shell's only accent: active tab/nav line, focus on black, day marker, the toast action."
    ],
    "rules": [
